75
00:17:53,220 --> 00:18:04,500
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Yan yung laman ng memo. Pero ang tanong ko, do you know why it was changed? Kasi parang lumalabas magkaiba yung paggamit nito if you look at the 1992 circular, iba sa 2015.

76
00:18:07,110 --> 00:18:31,090
Atty. Roderick C. Wamil: Doon po kasi sa yung Circular ng 1999, walang differentiation as to the CIF po. Pero doon sa 2015-01 kasi doon na in-specify na dapat yung Confidential Fund ay gagamitin lang sa ganito for civilian government agencies. Yung Intelligence Fund ay gagamitin lang ng uniform and military personnel as well as yung mga intelligence practitioners.

77
00:18:31,590 --> 00:18:36,510
