89
00:19:33,180 --> 00:19:46,600
Atty. Roderick C. Wamil: po kasi, ina-acknowledge doon nung recipient ng payment na natanggap niya yung payment. Pero yung OR po kasi, parang yun yung proof na nag-purchase si agency doon sa pinagbila nung item.

90
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:49,500
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Nung item. So pwede mong matrace? Kung OR, pwede nyo matrace?

91
