Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Is that as of 2015 or even in previous liquidation of confidential funds?

99
00:20:31,630 --> 00:20:42,210
Atty. Roderick C. Wamil: Based on my recollection po, even yung dating circulars po, buwat nung nag-assume po ako sa IGFA, wala naman pong provision as to the use of alias.

