104
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:09,140
Atty. Roderick C. Wamil: ang katulad nga po nung sinabi ko, document-based po kami. So, wala po kaming way to determine if this is an alias or not.

105
00:21:09,540 --> 00:21:13,360
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: But in general, ang tinatanggap yung dokumento, dapat totoong tao.

106
00:21:13,620 --> 00:21:14,320
Atty. Roderick C. Wamil: Yes, Your Honor.

107
